=   entry .Error   raised when a DNS name or message is not valid, or a name does not resolve
-     detail
+     detail

-         Error `↯/s.100.1`: _the DNS message is not valid because `reason`_. Raised by name construction
-         and parsing, by `Rdata.Txt`, by decoding a message from `Data`, by `Dns.resolve`, and
-         as a compile error by `dns"…"`.
-     entry .Reason   why a name, message or lookup failed
+         エラー `↯/s.100.1`：_the DNS message is not valid because `reason`_。
+         名前の構築とパース、`Rdata.Txt`、`Data` からのメッセージのデコード、`Dns.resolve` によって発生し、`dns"…"` ではコンパイルエラーとして発生する。
+     entry .Reason   名前、メッセージ、または検索が失敗した理由

=     entry .Reason   why a name, message or lookup failed
-       detail
+       detail

-           Each has a message through `Reason.communicable`:
+           それぞれ `Reason.communicable` を通じてメッセージを持つ。

=           Each has a message through `Reason.communicable`:
=
-           ```tabular
+           ```tabular

-           column  Case
-           column  Code
-           column  Message
-           column  Note
-           row  `Truncated(offset)`  1  _the message ends at offset `offset`, inside a field_  a malformed message
-           row  `BadPointer(offset)`  2  _the name pointer at offset `offset` points forward_  a malformed message
-           row  `BadLabel(offset, kind)`  3  _the label at offset `offset` has unsupported type `kind`_  a malformed message
-           row  `LongLabel(label)`  4  _the label `label` is longer than 63 octets_  a bad name
-           row  `LongName(name)`  5  _the name `name` is longer than 255 octets_  a bad name
-           row  `EmptyLabel(text)`  6  _the name `text` contains an empty label_  a bad name
-           row  `BadEscape(text)`  7  _the name `text` contains a malformed escape sequence_  a bad name
-           row  `BadRdata(rtype, offset)`  8  _the `rtype` record data at offset `offset` is malformed_  a malformed message
-           row  `LongString(length)`  9  _a character-string of `length` octets exceeds 255_  a TXT string
-           row  `Trailing(offset)`  10  _the message has trailing bytes from offset `offset`_  a malformed message
-           row  `Unresolved(name)`  11  _the name `name` could not be resolved_  from `Dns.resolve`
-           row  `Timeout`  12  _no response arrived before the timeout_  raised by a transport such as `coaxial.dns`
-           row  `Mismatch(id)`  13  _the response with ID `id` does not answer the query_  raised by a transport, for a response with the wrong ID
+           column  ケース
+           column  コード
+           column  メッセージ
+           column  備考
+           row  `Truncated(offset)`  1  _the message ends at offset `offset`, inside a field_  不正なメッセージ
+           row  `BadPointer(offset)`  2  _the name pointer at offset `offset` points forward_  不正なメッセージ
+           row  `BadLabel(offset, kind)`  3  _the label at offset `offset` has unsupported type `kind`_  不正なメッセージ
+           row  `LongLabel(label)`  4  _the label `label` is longer than 63 octets_  不正な名前
+           row  `LongName(name)`  5  _the name `name` is longer than 255 octets_  不正な名前
+           row  `EmptyLabel(text)`  6  _the name `text` contains an empty label_  不正な名前
+           row  `BadEscape(text)`  7  _the name `text` contains a malformed escape sequence_  不正な名前
+           row  `BadRdata(rtype, offset)`  8  _the `rtype` record data at offset `offset` is malformed_  不正なメッセージ
+           row  `LongString(length)`  9  _a character-string of `length` octets exceeds 255_  TXT の文字列
+           row  `Trailing(offset)`  10  _the message has trailing bytes from offset `offset`_  不正なメッセージ
+           row  `Unresolved(name)`  11  _the name `name` could not be resolved_  `Dns.resolve` から
+           row  `Timeout`  12  _no response arrived before the timeout_  `coaxial.dns` などのトランスポートが発生させる
+           row  `Mismatch(id)`  13  _the response with ID `id` does not answer the query_  ID の誤ったレスポンスに対してトランスポートが発生させる

=           row  `Mismatch(id)`  13  _the response with ID `id` does not answer the query_  raised by a transport, for a response with the wrong ID
-           ```
+           ```

-       entry .communicable   renders each reason as a message
-     entry #reason   why it failed
+       entry .communicable   それぞれの理由をメッセージとして描画する
+     entry #reason   失敗した理由

- entry .dns   the `dns"…"` interpolator: a DNS name in presentation form, checked as the code compiles
-     `dns"_fury._tcp.local"` is a `Dns.Name`, parsed as `Dns.Name.parse` does — with `\.`,
-     `\\` and `\DDD` escapes and an optional trailing dot — and a name which breaks the limits
-     is a compile error carrying the `Dns.Error` message. It takes no substitutions. Declared
-     in `urticose.dns`.
+ entry .dns   `dns"…"` 補間子：コンパイル時に検査される、プレゼンテーション形式の DNS 名
+     `dns"_fury._tcp.local"` は `Dns.Name` であり、`Dns.Name.parse` と同じように（`\.`、`\\`、`\DDD` のエスケープと、省略可能な末尾のドットを含めて）パースされる。
+     制限を破る名前は、`Dns.Error` のメッセージを伴うコンパイルエラーになる。
+     埋め込みは受け取らない。
+     `urticose.dns` で宣言されている。

